WEBVTT

00:09:28.234 --> 00:09:31.690
Armed with this knowledge,
SANCCOB has a chick-bolstering project,

00:09:31.714 --> 00:09:34.690
and every year, they rescue
and raise abandoned chicks,

00:09:34.714 --> 00:09:39.238
and they have a very impressive,
80 percent success rate.

00:09:39.262 --> 00:09:41.122
This is critically important,

00:09:41.146 --> 00:09:43.574
because one year ago,

00:09:43.598 --> 00:09:46.511
the African penguin
was declared endangered.

00:09:46.948 --> 00:09:50.754
And they could be extinct
in less than 10 years

00:09:50.778 --> 00:09:53.659
if we don't do something
now to protect them.

00:09:53.683 --> 00:09:54.976
So what did I learn

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:58.180
from this intense
and unforgettable experience?

00:09:58.204 --> 00:10:01.768
Personally, I learned that I am capable
of handling so much more